      "content": "gentle doesn't really change the fact that there's nothing left to do. i spend all day just waiting for something to happen, but nothing does. it's like i'm stuck in a waiting room for a life that already ended. i just feel so much more dignity in being able to decide when it's over, rather than just decaying like this.",
